(7806195, 1303068, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Definitely looks like the sort of juxtaposition and documentary vibe that might have caught Parr''s eye. Good one.</td>', 'Definitely looks like the sort of juxtaposition and documentary vibe that might have caught Parr''s eye. Good one.', '2025-12-31 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7806197, 1303038, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Yes. This feels exactly like a "Parr moment" in progress. The intersecting stories, the sense of bizarre ordinariness of what''s happening in the frame, the seemingly obliviousness of the subjects to the camera--it''s all here. Even the slight tilt, making it feel more candid than composed. I''m no Parr connoisseur, but from what I''ve seen of his work, this seems to "get" his aesthetic quite well and is one of my top picks this challenge.</td>', 'Yes. This feels exactly like a "Parr moment" in progress. The intersecting stories, the sense of bizarre ordinariness of what''s happening in the frame, the seemingly obliviousness of the subjects to the camera--it''s all here. Even the slight tilt, making it feel more candid than composed. I''m no Parr connoisseur, but from what I''ve seen of his work, this seems to "get" his aesthetic quite well and is one of my top picks this challenge.', '2025-12-31 11:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
